{"about_the_game":"<i>Welcome to the world of cozy correspondence, where you are a postcard designer!</i><br><br><strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> is a wholesome postcard-making sandbox game where you take on the charming job of a postcard designer. Craft delightful cards, decorate with adorable stickers, write sweet notes, and match the perfect stamp\u2014all while enjoying relaxing tunes and satisfying vibes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.poster.avif?t=1774501151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.webm?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.mp4?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you\u2019re creating personalized mail for quirky customers or building your own dreamy stamp collection, there\u2019s always a reason to send a little joy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.poster.avif?t=1774501151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.webm?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.mp4?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcee Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft &amp; Sell:</strong> Take on customer orders and craft postcards that match their unique requests and personalities.<br></li><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Decorate with a wide variety of cute stickers, washi tapes, doodles, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Write Notes:</strong> Pen short, wholesome messages to make every postcard feel personal and heartfelt.<br></li><li><strong>Collect Stamps:</strong> Unlock and collect a colorful assortment of stamps\u2014from vintage vibes to quirky icons.<br></li><li><strong>Wholesome Sandbox Mode:</strong> No timers. No pressure. Just cozy creativity and peaceful play.<br></li><li><strong>Relaxing Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy calming background tunes while you let your creativity flow.<br></li><li><strong>Mailing Magic:</strong> Drop your finished postcards into the mailbox and watch them go on their way!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.poster.avif?t=1774501151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.webm?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.mp4?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Game for Stationery Lovers</strong></h2>If you\u2019ve ever fallen down a sticker organization rabbit hole or lost time browsing through cute stationery, this is the game for you. <strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> turns the art of mailing into a joyful experience.<br><br><i>So grab your favorite pen, pick out a stamp, and let the postcard magic begin!</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stamps of the Rising Sun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/4235d6a307d8aef11ed2749011d4b09e65d5522e.jpg"},{"name":"A Breath of Fresh Air","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/6aafd7f542c779bbacf75391cad63cdc20ef0dc0.jpg"},{"name":"Tiny Companions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/d0f7eb8bf642f93940b1806c49192ace20875666.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Tooth Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/61b833aff0db8fbc736aafb3876f79c50cc5c45b.jpg"},{"name":"Kitchen Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/73cd2d6372b79ccfd5cc9f4c86a5214baba8af77.jpg"},{"name":"Home Comforts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/db99e6f66b4abfbc1639656ddab1945d3d35a998.jpg"},{"name":"Green Thumb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/063c90cbbc47602661de7335dcbde3c34824402c.jpg"},{"name":"The Finishing Touch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/1be82fb5c776e56e44a95c11b060fdda1990e97c.jpg"},{"name":"Colors of Autumn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/dd71c040cfb3611347022b0a0533a9847615fa4a.jpg"},{"name":"Foodie Heaven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771390/70935d4b5927405545a932070f3cf5ee6b646ebb.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771390?t=1774501151","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771390?t=1774501151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/fb09952373e292c37dedde6a6994e18c74a651dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774501151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/fb09952373e292c37dedde6a6994e18c74a651dd/capsu