pps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.poster.avif?t=1774501151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.webm?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.mp4?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcee Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft &amp; Sell:</strong> Take on customer orders and craft postcards that match their unique requests and personalities.<br></li><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Decorate with a wide variety of cute stickers, washi tapes, doodles, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Write Notes:</strong> Pen short, wholesome messages to make every postcard feel personal and heartfelt.<br></li><li><strong>Collect Stamps:</strong> Unlock and collect a colorful assortment of stamps\u2014from vintage vibes to quirky icons.<br></li><li><strong>Wholesome Sandbox Mode:</strong> No timers. No pressure. Just cozy creativity and peaceful play.<br></li><li><strong>Relaxing Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy calming background tunes while you let your creativity flow.<br></li><li><strong>Mailing Magic:</strong> Drop your finished postcards into the mailbox and watch them go on their way!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.poster.avif?t=1774501151\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.webm?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.mp4?t=1774501151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Game for Stationery Lovers</strong></h2>If you\u2019ve ever fallen down a sticker organization rabbit hole or lost time browsing through cute stationery, this is the game for you. <strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> turns the art of mailing into a joyful experience.<br><br><i>So grab your favorite pen, pick out a stamp, and let the postcard magic begin!</i>","developers":["Rogue Duck Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/79b57bb78e9df68e6b08afffdb8ff75a579a04da/header.jpg?t=1774501151","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 - Rogue Duck Interactive, Published by Rogue Duck Interactive LLC and Co-published in Asia Regions (China, Korea, Japan) by Gamersky Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04, SteamOS (Proton-8 Recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8 or higher, ATI X1600 or higher, or Intel HD 3000 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Proton-8 Recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.6 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1 (M2 and M3) or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1280x720 minimum resolution, OpenGL 2.0 Support, and rec